nd in conversation with people who disagree with them.\",\"split_by\":\"character\",\"variant\":\"word\",\"dim_color\":\"\",\"highlight_color\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"blk_6a8dd99b76ad9\",\"type\":\"statistics\",\"styles\":{\"padding_top\":\"py-20\",\"padding_bottom\":\"py-20\"},\"variant\":\"minimal-editorial\",\"title\":\"The Institute, Measured\",\"subtitle\":\"The few numbers we publish.\",\"source\":\"live\"},{\"id\":\"blk_6a8dd99b76ada\",\"type\":\"features_grid\",\"styles\":{\"padding_top\":\"py-20\",\"padding_bottom\":\"py-20\"},\"variant\":\"icon-list\",\"title\":\"Four Commitments\",\"subtitle\":\"What we will and will not do.\",\"features\":[{\"title\":\"Small Seminars\",\"desc\":\"Never more than sixteen pupils in a class.\"},{\"title\":\"Primary Sources\",\"desc\":\"Original texts, not summaries of summaries.\"},{\"title\":\"Slow Assessment\",\"desc\":\"Fewer exams; more essays, orals and portfolios.\"},{\"title\":\"Silence & Solitude\",\"desc\":\"Protected time to think, every single day.\"}]},{\"id\":\"blk_6a8dd99b76afb\",\"type\":\"gallery\",\"styles\":{\"padding_top\":\"py-20\",\"padding_bottom\":\"py-20\"},\"variant\":\"masonry\",\"title\":\"The Campus\",\"columns\":3,\"images\":[{\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/chiwariraprimary.lvh.me\\/images\\/placeholders\\/library.svg\",\"caption\":\"The Reading Room\"},{\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/chiwariraprimary.lvh.me\\/images\\/placeholders\\/campus-quad.svg\",\"caption\":\"The Quad\"},{\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/chiwariraprimary.lvh.me\\/images\\/placeholders\\/classroom.svg\",\"caption\":\"Seminar 4\"},{\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/chiwariraprimary.lvh.me\\/images\\/placeholders\\/assembly-hall.svg\",\"caption\":\"The Hall\"},{\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/chiwariraprimary.lvh.me\\/images\\/placeholders\\/students-library.svg\",\"caption\":\"Study Carrels\"},{\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/chiwariraprimary.lvh.me\\/images\\/placeholders\\/science-lab.svg\",\"caption\":\"Laboratory\"}]},{\"id\":\"blk_6a8dd99b76afc\",\"type\":\"testimonials\",\"